WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:15,440
Hyperbaric oxygen therapy, H-bot therapy was listed as a treatment recommendation on my genetics

00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:20,560
summary and research in that treatment I found in a number of places that describe the treatment as

00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:29,520
including breathing 100% oxygen. I assume through a mask or under a nose tube so I don't know

00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:37,520
anywhere where you could breathe 100% oxygen that would be I think dangerous and probably deadly.

00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:47,840
So I'm not familiar with that whatsoever. Being in a chamber tend with pressurized oxygen is what

00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:54,240
hyperbaric oxygen is. My doctor also has H-bot available during my first treatment. I was surprised

00:00:54,240 --> 00:01:01,920
that he did not include breathing 100% oxygen. So I talked about that already. It only included

00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:09,920
the pressurized chamber. So that's what I would do. I would just do H-bot chamber.

00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:17,920
So yeah, just do the H-bot chamber.

